## Decisions and Action Items

### Decisions
* No formal standard consensus decisions or working group polls were conducted during this orientation session.

### Action Items for New Participants
* **Registration & Tools**: Create a Data Tracker account and log into Meetecho using room QR codes during technical sessions.
* **Networking & Mentorship**: Sign up for the IETF Guides Program and attend the Quick Connections networking event.
* **Mailing Lists**: Subscribe to targeted working group mailing lists and review active drafts prior to attending sessions.
* **Hackathon & Side Meetings**: Review the Hackathon wiki for upcoming projects and check the agenda for IAB New Work Help Desk hours and AD office hours.